@page "/privacy"

<h3>Privacy Policy</h3>

<div class="card mt-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title">Your Data, Your Control</h5>
        <p>
            This application stores expense entries you upload (receipts, PDFs, images, or JSON files)
            in a secure database. Data remains available until you delete it from your dashboard.
            Data is processed within this application and Microsoft Azure services (such as OCR and PDF generation). No data is shared with unauthorized third parties.
        </p>
        <p>
            By using this app, you consent to your uploaded data being stored for demonstration purposes.
            You may delete your entries at any time, and they will be permanently removed from the system.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
